data/
*.csv
*.parquet
*.json
*.zip

# =================( 5. Trained Models )=================
# Large model binaries (.joblib, .pkl, .h5). 
# If they are small (<50MB) you can remove this line, but heavy models belong in cloud storage or Git LFS.
models/*.joblib
models/*.pkl